import dept/utils
// Fosved Office v2 — Admin Dispatcher v2.0 (NATIVE)
// 14 commands: status, build, fix, analyze, scan, tour, docs, graph, impact, proposals, narads, rollback, report, health
// Night cycle: 7 phases (scan → analyze → graph → review → metrics → autofix → proposals → docs → health)
// UA 6 sub-agents: Scanner, Analyzer, Grapher, Reviewer, Differ, Documenter
// Knowledge graph, code audit, autofix engine, proposal generator
// ENRICHED: 0 CallLLMProxy, 10 native call_llm, hard gates, lifecycle, disclaimer, cross-dept routing

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
